-- The server builds flight splines from its own TaxiPathNode.dbc, so a copy of that file which carries
-- other points for a path (or the points of another route) sends players across the map on routes the
-- client never draws. Re-state every route from the client data. Paths this project already places by
-- hand (the Pale Reach and Graysky flights, the building clearances) keep their rows and are skipped here
-- so those landing points survive.
